<div class="card"><h2>03 · Penilaian & pengesahan</h2><p class="muted">Simpan konfirmasi seluruh jawaban sebelum memulai penilaian.</p><p class="small muted">Penilaian subjektif menggunakan transkripsi dan deskripsi visual yang Anda konfirmasikan. Pastikan hubungan diagram, simbol, indentasi kode, dan langkah rumus sudah lengkap.</p>
<div class="actions"><button class="button" @click="gradeAll()" :disabled="busy||dirty||!['ready','graded'].includes(revision.status)">Nilai jawaban terkonfirmasi</button><button class="button secondary" @click="finalize()" :disabled="busy||dirty||revision.status!=='graded'">Sahkan nilai akhir</button></div>
<template x-if="revision.status==='finalized'"><p class="stat" x-text="Number(revision.final_score).toFixed(2)"></p></template>
<template x-for="grade in grades" :key="grade.id"><div class="card" style="background:#f8faf5"><h3 x-text="'Soal '+question(grade.question_id).number+' · '+grade.score+' / '+question(grade.question_id).weight"></h3><p x-text="grade.feedback"></p><p class="small muted" x-text="'Sumber: '+({ai:'Gemini',application:'Kunci jawaban',teacher:'Penyesuaian guru'}[grade.source]||grade.source)+(grade.model_name?' · '+grade.model_name:'')"></p>
<template x-for="(criterion,index) in grade.criteria_scores" :key="index"><p class="small" x-text="criterion.label+': '+criterion.score+' / '+criterion.max_score+' · '+criterion.reason"></p></template>
<details x-show="revision.status!=='finalized'"><summary>Ubah skor dengan alasan</summary><template x-if="!question(grade.question_id).criteria.length"><label>Skor baru<input type="number" min="0" :max="question(grade.question_id).weight" step=".0001" x-model.number="grade.overrideScore"></label></template>
<template x-for="(criterion,index) in grade.criteria_scores" :key="index"><label><span x-text="criterion.label"></span><input type="number" min="0" :max="criterion.max_score" step=".0001" x-model.number="criterion.overrideScore"></label></template><label>Alasan perubahan<textarea x-model="grade.overrideReason"></textarea></label><button class="button secondary" @click="overrideGrade(grade)" :disabled="busy||dirty">Simpan perubahan skor</button></details>
<template x-for="change in grade.changes" :key="change.id"><p class="small muted" x-text="'Riwayat perubahan: '+change.reason"></p></template>
</div></template></div>
